%% Sequence Diagram — B-LEAK proativo pos-upload CSV (Coach-2B RF-08)
%% ADR-085 (engine) + ADR-084 (preferences)
%%
%% NAO eh cron — eh setImmediate async no request handler de POST /api/upload/csv.
%% NAO bloqueia HTTP response do upload.
%%
%% Detecta leak NOVO (nao mencionado em chat_messages.content nas ultimas 30d)
%% e dispara conversa proativa via shouldSendNudge.
%%
%% cycleKey = YYYY-WW (semanal). Garante max 1 nudge B-LEAK por semana mesmo
%% se user fizer multiplos uploads.

sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Upload as POST /api/upload/csv
    participant CSVParser as PokerCSVParser
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Async as setImmediate<br/>processCoachLeakDetection
    participant LeakDet as coachLeakDetection<br/>detectLeaks
    participant ChatGrep as storage.findRecentLeakMentions<br/>(grep chat_messages content)
    participant Engine as shouldSendNudge ADR-085
    participant Storage as server/storage

    User->>Upload: POST CSV (PokerStars histarial.txt)
    Upload->>CSVParser: parse(file)
    CSVParser-->>Upload: tournaments[]
    Upload->>DB: BEGIN<br/>INSERT N tournaments<br/>UPDATE upload_history<br/>COMMIT
    DB-->>Upload: ok

    Upload-->>User: 200 OK<br/>{ imported: N, ... }
    Note over Upload: HTTP response retornada<br/>antes do processamento async

    Upload->>Async: setImmediate(<br/>processCoachLeakDetection<br/>{userId, uploadId})

    rect rgba(150, 230, 200, 0.15)
    Note over Async,Storage: Background processing (lesson #9: per-user try/catch)

    Async->>LeakDet: detectLeaks(userId,<br/>{minSeverity: 'medium', limit: 5})
    LeakDet->>DB: queries de analise<br/>(roi por categoria, ITM, etc)
    DB-->>LeakDet: stats
    LeakDet-->>Async: leaks[] (codes + evidence + sample)

    alt leaks.length === 0
        Note over Async: skip silently<br/>telemetry coach.leak.no_leaks_detected
    else leaks.length >= 1
        Async->>ChatGrep: findRecentLeakMentions(<br/>userId, leakCodes,<br/>since=now-30d)
        Note over ChatGrep: grep simples em chat_messages.content<br/>WHERE role=assistant AND content LIKE '%{leakCode}%'<br/>AND created_at > now-30d
        ChatGrep->>DB: SELECT chat_messages WHERE...
        DB-->>ChatGrep: mentioned[]
        ChatGrep-->>Async: leakCodesMentioned

        Async->>Async: novelLeaks = leaks.filter(l => !mentionedSet.has(l.code))

        alt novelLeaks.length === 0
            Note over Async: skip + telemetry coach.leak.all_already_mentioned
        else novelLeaks.length >= 1
            Async->>Engine: shouldSendNudge(userId,<br/>{category: 'B-LEAK',<br/>cycleKey: 'YYYY-WW' formato ISO,<br/>now: new Date()})<br/>ADR-085

            Engine-->>Async: decision

            alt decision.allow == false
                Note over Async: skip + log<br/>(opt-out / quiet hours / cap / cycle ja sent essa semana)
            else decision.allow == true
                Note over Async: Begin tx (lesson #194)
                Async->>DB: BEGIN
                Async->>Storage: createChatSession<br/>(userId, coachType='technical',<br/>title='Leaks novos detectados')
                Storage->>DB: INSERT chat_sessions
                DB-->>Storage: chatSessionId

                Note over Async: Mensagem template:<br/>"Acabei de processar seus N torneios novos.<br/>Detectei M leak(s) que nao discutimos antes:<br/>{lista de leaks com severidade + evidencia + sample}.<br/>Quer revisar agora ou prefere mais tarde?"

                Async->>Storage: createChatMessage<br/>(role='assistant', content=template)
                Storage->>DB: INSERT chat_messages
                DB-->>Storage: messageId

                Async->>Storage: createNudgeLog(<br/>userId,<br/>category='B-LEAK',<br/>cycleKey='YYYY-WW',<br/>status='sent',<br/>title_i18n=template title,<br/>body_preview=first 500 chars,<br/>chat_session_id,<br/>triggered_by_event='csv_upload',<br/>metadata={leakCodes: novelLeaks.map(c=>c.code)})
                Storage->>DB: INSERT coach_nudge_log
                DB-->>Storage: nudgeLogId
                Async->>DB: COMMIT

                Note over Async: Telemetria<br/>coach.nudge.b_leak.sent<br/>{userId, cycleKey, leakCodes: [...]}
            end
        end
    end
    end

    rect rgba(255, 220, 220, 0.15)
    Note over Async,DB: Failure modes (lesson #9):<br/>- detectLeaks DB error → log + abort (upload nao afetado)<br/>- ChatGrep timeout → log + assume todos novos (false positive aceito)<br/>- shouldSendNudge engine_error → DENY safe (sem nudge)<br/>- INSERT chat_messages falha → ROLLBACK, sem nudge<br/>Em TODOS casos: HTTP 200 ja foi devolvido ao user; falha silenciosa no async
    end

    rect rgba(220, 200, 255, 0.15)
    Note over Async,Storage: Edge case — 2 uploads same week<br/>com leaks DIFERENTES:<br/>1o upload: B-LEAK enviado (cycleKey=2026-WK18)<br/>2o upload mesma semana: shouldSendNudge DENY<br/>'already_sent_this_cycle' (mesmo se leaks novos)<br/>Decisao consciente: 1 nudge/semana max<br/>(user pode abrir conversa manual)
    end
